OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FDry and
OL,6,Foften clear this evening and
OL,7,Fovernight, turning chilly with a touch
OL,8,Fof frost in places. The odd mist and
OL,9,Ffog patch also possible.
OL,10,
OL,11,CMonday:FMainly dry and bright with
OL,12,Foccasional sunny breaks. Cloudier at
OL,13,Ftimes with isolated showers. Winds
OL,14,Fwill be light and variable.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FPlenty
OL,17,Fdry and settled weather under an area
OL,18,Fof high pressure. Variable cloud
OL,19,Famounts with some clear or sunny
OL,20,Fspells possible at times. Frost and
OL,21,Ffog if skies remain clear.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
